{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological narrative game where dialogue is combat, nine personas fight to survive, and every choice pushes the story toward a different ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Essentially, this is a nervous breakdown simulator wearing a cheap suit.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nine versions of Clive are battling for control of the same mind. You choose which persona speaks - and what they say - to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every conversation is a weapon</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every win exposes another piece of Clive\u2019s disturbing past</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lose, and a persona disappears forever</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological narrative gameplay </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical dialogue battles </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching story paths </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live-action FMV performances </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One actor playing nine competing personas</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016950/extras/2721303ceedf759dfde947e9577273dc.avif?t=1773518920\" width=1234 height=644 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Clive hosts the show. He wants you to lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you like your games unsettling, stylish, and unforgettable -\u00a0<strong>Wishlist Clive is a Good Guy</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Clive is waiting...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Featuring NEIL BELL</strong><br>(Star Wars: Andor, Dune, Peaky Blinders, Adolescence) as every persona (and Clive) - a one-man psychological demolition job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Original score by SANO DG</strong><br>(Tekken, Drakengard, Ridge Racer) driving the chaos with a cold, hypnotic pulse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016950/extras/5f6da6360a209d109a8dca4664b4ec1a.avif?t=1773518920\" width=440 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016950?t=1773518920","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016950/6e67548f7d6a18d7fe3e4a0b327e28781e759be4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773518920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016950/f2a18521814f6e8117c1ff137ff4b9d40fd97fa4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773518920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016950/f2a18521814f6e8117c1ff137ff4b9d40fd97fa4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773518920","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Clive has dissociative identity disorder resulting in some odd behaviour."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_pa